# counter harness. One force call is one RgpotCounter.calculate entry.
# Each analytic Hessian costs one force call per coordinate.
# gradient_calls is the harness energy and gradient. hessian_calls counts matrices. hessian_force_calls is matrices times the dimension. force_calls is their sum.
